                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.16.9+DEU.16.10+DEU.16.11+DEU.16.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amaf 16:9-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe akonkenyepo nokuti, “Kabili ukufuma pa bushiku bwe Sabata nga bwapita, ubushiku mwaletele no kutuula umwanshi wa ŋanu ngo mutuulo wa cakutambika, mufwile ukupenda imilungu ituntulu cine lubali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili mukapende inshiku amakumi yasano (50) ukufika pa bushiku bukakonkapo panuma ye Sabata lyalenga cine lubali, elyo nomba mulete umutuulo wa cabunga bupya kuli Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukufumafye konse uko mukekala, cila muntu alingile ukuleta imikate ibili iyapangilwa no bunga bwa ŋanu ubwapeleka bwino ubwapangilwa ku twapekumi tubili utwa ku cipimo ca efa, kabili umwaba intutumushi. Uyu e mutuulo wakutambika uwa fisabo fyantanshi kuli Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukulunda pa mikate, muli nokutuula impaanga ishilume cine lubali ishili no mwaka umo ishabula ubulema, ne ciponti na basukusuku babili. Ifi fyonse fili nokuba umutuulo we lambo lyakoca kuli Yawe, pamo pene no mutuulo wabo uwa cabunga no mutuulo wa fyakunwa, umutuulo wa cakoca uwa cena cisuma icisekesha Yawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili muli nokutuula sawe umo ngo mutuulo wakwelelwa pa bubifi, no twana twa mpaanga tubili utwa mwaka umo ngo mutuulo wakwampana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shimapepo ali nokutambika utwana twa mpaanga tubili kuli Yawe, pamo pene no mukate wa fitwalo fyantanshi, ngo mutuulo wakutambika. Ifi fyonse mutuulo wamushilo kuli Yawe uwakwa shimapepo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pali bulya bwine bushiku muli nokubilisha ukulongana kwamushilo kabili takuli nakubombamo imilimo ya cila bushiku. Ili lifunde lyamuyayaya ilili nokukonkwa umukakonkanina inkulo, uko konse mwikala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
